/-!
# S9-C3h148: P506 matter-current Einstein--Cartan feedback actual

The exact P506/L0 matter current already generates the complete torsion-free
current actual `U₀`.  This module now lets that actual representation action
generate a primitive connection update before a new local actual is built:

```text
source + current state
→ current torsion-free actual U₀ at every spatial contact
→ actual Dirac spin covector of U₀
→ fixed action-normalized Einstein--Cartan contorsion
→ primitive Lorentz connection update
→ sourceActionGeneratedJointLocalActualLift
→ new complete local actual U₁
→ Lorentz Euler--Lagrange acceptance.
```

The spin is not a caller input: it is read internally from the generated
`U₀`.  The contorsion is then added to the current primitive connection and
all departments of `U₁` are regenerated by the existing joint local action
constructor.  Only after `U₁` exists do we prove its all-direction Lorentz
balance.

This closes spin-to-connection feedback at the identity/simple-`B` P506
mouth.  It does not yet claim matter-stress feedback into the coframe,
nonlinear integral-flow closure, global extension, or simultaneous full
Stage-9 stationarity.  No residual, endpoint, inverse, range witness,
quotient representative, source knob, branch receipt, or supplied
stationarity certificate enters a constructor.
-/

